## Keep Title, Version and Main.lua VERSION in sync.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s ChatAssistant|r 1.9.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Opens the console chat entry box, and the console's text input screen with it, from the keyboard's Enter key. Run /pbchat to set it up.
## Version: 1.9.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
